{"id":"3191e06d903b178e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/569_证明逻辑_LP.md","title":"569 证明逻辑 LP","display":"569_证明逻辑_LP","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{569}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}_{569}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PVar}_{569}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{PVar}_{569}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PConst}_{569}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{PConst}_{569}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。证明项构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{bang}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{bang}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sum}(s,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{sum}(s,t)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\">\\(s+t\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(s,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(s,t)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\cdot t\">\\(s\\cdot t\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bang}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{bang}(t)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!t\">\\(!t\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{just}(t,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{just}(t,A)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\">\\(t:A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-证明项与公式\">2. 证明项与公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{569}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{569}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\">\\(\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{569}\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{569}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\">\\(\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\">\\(s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\">\\(s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\">\\(!t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{569}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{569}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\">\\(t:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由符号与替换\">3. 自由符号与替换</h1>\n<p>定义自由符号函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{569}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{569}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{569}:\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{569}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{569}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{569}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{569}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{569}:\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{569}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{569}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明项语言无绑定构造子。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{569}:\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{569}(U)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{569}:\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{569}(U)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>新鲜证明变量函数只用于外部结构操作：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshP}_{569}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{569})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{569},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{569}(E)=x_m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshP}_{569}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{569})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{569},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{569}(E)=x_m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>命题自由符号函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{569}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{569})\">\\(\\operatorname{PV}_{569}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{569})\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(t:A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(t:A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{569}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明变量自由符号函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{569}:\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{569})\">\\(\\operatorname{TV}_{569}:\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{569})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{569})\">\\(\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{569})\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(!t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(!t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(t:A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(t:A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{569}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{569}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{569}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{569}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\)</span> 为有限支撑命题替换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(A,\\sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(A,\\sigma)\\)</span> 由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(B,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(B,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(t:A,\\sigma)=t:\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(t:A,\\sigma)=t:\\operatorname{SubP}_{569}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{569}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{569}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\)</span> 为有限支撑证明项替换。项替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(t,\\theta)\">\\(\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(t,\\theta)\\)</span> 与公式项替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(A,\\theta)\">\\(\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(A,\\theta)\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(t,\\theta),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(!t,\\theta)=!\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(t,\\theta),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(!t,\\theta)=!\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(A,\\theta),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(B,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(A,\\theta),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(B,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(t:A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(t,\\theta):\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(A,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(t:A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{569}(t,\\theta):\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569}(A,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统无绑定构造子，捕获规避重命名恒为恒等操作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,569}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,569}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\)</span> 上的构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{569}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{569}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{569}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{569}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{569}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{569}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>LP 证明项公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{569}=\\{s:(A\\to B)\\to(t:A\\to(s\\cdot t):B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{569}=\\{s:(A\\to B)\\to(t:A\\to(s\\cdot t):B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{569}=\\{s:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{569}=\\{s:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{569}=\\{t:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{569}=\\{t:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{569}=\\{t:A\\to A:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{569}=\\{t:A\\to A:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{569}=\\{t:A\\to !t:(t:A):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{569}=\\{t:A\\to !t:(t:A):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{569},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxBase}_{569}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{569}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{569}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{569}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{569}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{569}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{569}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{569}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{569}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxBase}_{569}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{569}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{569}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{569}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{569}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{569}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{569}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{569}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{569}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>常元规范是参数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CS}_{569}\\subseteq\\{c:A:c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{569},A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{569}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CS}_{569}\\subseteq\\{c:A:c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{569},A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{569}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{569}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{569}\\cup\\mathsf{CS}_{569}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{569}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{569}\\cup\\mathsf{CS}_{569}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{569}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{569}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{569}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{569}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{569}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{569}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{569}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{569}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{569}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{569}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{569}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,569}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,569}A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{569}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{569}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{569}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{569}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-LP-证书\">8. LP 证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"569\">\\(569\\)</span>-LP 证书为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q,s,t,A,B)\">\\((Q,s,t,A,B)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{App,SumL,SumR,T,4\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{App,SumL,SumR,T,4\\}\\)</span>。各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 分别指定第 4 节中的应用、和左、和右、真实性、正内省五个证明项公理族。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与满足\">9. 语义结构与满足</h1>\n<p>定义相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CS}_{569}\">\\(\\mathsf{CS}_{569}\\)</span> 的证据函数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ev}_{569}(\\mathsf{CS}_{569})\">\\(\\mathsf{Ev}_{569}(\\mathsf{CS}_{569})\\)</span>。其元素为函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E:\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{569})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E:\\mathsf{Term}_{569}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{569})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且满足下列闭包条件：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in E(s)\\land A\\in E(t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(s\\cdot t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\to B\\in E(s)\\land A\\in E(t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(s\\cdot t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E(s)\\cup E(t)\\subseteq E(s+t),\n\\qquad\nA\\in E(t)\\Rightarrow t:A\\in E(!t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E(s)\\cup E(t)\\subseteq E(s+t),\n\\qquad\nA\\in E(t)\\Rightarrow t:A\\in E(!t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c:A\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{569}\\Rightarrow A\\in E(\\operatorname{pconst}(c)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c:A\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{569}\\Rightarrow A\\in E(\\operatorname{pconst}(c)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"569\">\\(569\\)</span>-Mkrtychev 模型类</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MMod}_{569}\n=\\{(V,E):V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{569}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\ E\\in\\mathsf{Ev}_{569}(\\mathsf{CS}_{569})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{MMod}_{569}\n=\\{(V,E):V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{569}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\ E\\in\\mathsf{Ev}_{569}(\\mathsf{CS}_{569})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}A\">\\(\\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}A\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(V,E)\">\\(\\mathcal M=(V,E)\\)</span> 递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow V(p)=1,\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal M\\not\\Vdash_{569}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow V(p)=1,\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal M\\not\\Vdash_{569}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal M\\not\\Vdash_{569}A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal M\\not\\Vdash_{569}A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal M\\not\\Vdash_{569}A\\ \\lor\\ \\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal M\\not\\Vdash_{569}A\\ \\lor\\ \\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}t:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(t)\\land \\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}t:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(t)\\land \\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{569}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{MMod}_{569}\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{569}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{MMod}_{569}\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M\\Vdash_{569}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标增量是同时含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{569}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{569}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{569}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{569}\\)</span>；不加入疑问项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"?\">\\(?\\)</span>、模态盒构造子或负内省公理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{LP}_{569}=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{569},\\mathsf{PVar}_{569},\\mathsf{PConst}_{569},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{569},\\mathsf{Frm}_{569},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{569},\\operatorname{TV}_{569},\\operatorname{TVF}_{569},\\operatorname{BV}_{569},\\operatorname{freshP}_{569},\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{569},\\operatorname{SubT}_{569},\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569},\\equiv_{\\alpha,569},\n\\mathsf{CS}_{569},\\mathsf{Ax}_{569},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{569},\\mathsf{Proof}_{569},\\vdash_{569},\n\\mathsf{Ev}_{569},\\mathsf{MMod}_{569},\\Vdash_{569},\\models_{569}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{LP}_{569}=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{569},\\mathsf{PVar}_{569},\\mathsf{PConst}_{569},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{569},\\mathsf{Frm}_{569},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{569},\\operatorname{TV}_{569},\\operatorname{TVF}_{569},\\operatorname{BV}_{569},\\operatorname{freshP}_{569},\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{569},\\operatorname{SubT}_{569},\\operatorname{SubJ}_{569},\\equiv_{\\alpha,569},\n\\mathsf{CS}_{569},\\mathsf{Ax}_{569},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{569},\\mathsf{Proof}_{569},\\vdash_{569},\n\\mathsf{Ev}_{569},\\mathsf{MMod}_{569},\\Vdash_{569},\\models_{569}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含显式证明项句法、公理、规则、证明对象、可证性、证据函数语义、Mkrtychev 模型与语义后承；不在本条目中断言实现函数、可靠性或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-证明项与公式","text":"2. 证明项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由符号与替换","text":"3. 自由符号与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理族","text":"4. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-LP-证书","text":"8. LP 证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-语义结构与满足","text":"9. 语义结构与满足","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{569}=\\{p_